# scrollcraft build output. A single build with video legs runs 300MB+, and a
# working lab directory can reach several GB. The fingerprint registry
# (scrollcraft/FINGERPRINTS.md) is deliberately NOT ignored: it is the record
# that keeps each new build from repeating an earlier one.
# Build SOURCE (index.html, BRIEF.md, the themed engine copy) is committed:
# it is the deliverable. Only the heavy working directories are ignored.
scrollcraft/lab/
scrollcraft/builds/*/lab/
scrollcraft/builds/*/out/
scrollcraft/builds/*/assets/*.mp4
*.mp4
*.mov
*.webm
!scroll-craft/media/*.webp

# Secrets
.env
.env.local
*.key

# Node
node_modules/
package-lock.json

# Claude Code local overrides
.claude/settings.local.json

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
scrollcraft/builds/*/serve.log
